{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00499","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 凯安 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛德陈万舞，威棱畅九垓。\n风云交律候，日月丽昭回。\n行庆休祥发，乘和春气来。\n百神肃临享，荡荡天门开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}